UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetDefaultFeeCap
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when default fee cap is higher than max fee cap
    │   └── it should revert with "MFC"
    └── when default fee cap is less than or equal to max fee cap
        ├── when default fee cap is zero
        │   └── it should revert with "FC0"
        └── when default fee cap is gt zero
            ├── it should set defaultFeeCap
            └── it should emit a DefaultFeeCapSet event
